  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2021</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1012</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
