  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2021</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2021</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2022</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2021</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2022</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4043</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>The number of terms in the bracket&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2022</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1011</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1011</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1010</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1011</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2023</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2023</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1012</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1012</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>17</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
